  "limitations": [
    "One ABBA block on one hosted Intel Mac per document/workload; two processes per backend are not broad performance assurance.",
    "The first observation in each process is excluded from operation medians. Remaining observations within that process are dependent.",
    "firstRasterUs, imageReadyUs and imageReadyFrameSubmittedUs are cumulative from open, not isolated render/paint durations.",
    "The frame-submitted endpoint follows endOfFrame and does not measure physical display presentation.",
    "Text/raster signatures are recorded independently. Different backend output is not accepted as equivalent rendering or Hebrew extraction.",
    "Queued cancellation reports whether an image returned, not whether native rendering/pixel work occurred before cancellation.",
